{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01UgzuUogc4jpKRPRCC4hEki","type":"tool_result","content":"common/huf.h:167:/*! HUF_readStats() :\ncommon/huf.h:172:size_t HUF_readStats(BYTE* huffWeight, size_t hwSize,\ncommon/huf.h:176:/*! HUF_readStats_wksp() :\ncommon/huf.h:177: * Same as HUF_readStats() but takes an external workspace which must be\ncommon/huf.h:183:size_t HUF_readStats_wksp(BYTE* huffWeight, size_t hwSize,\ncommon/fse.h:83:/*! FSE_optimalTableLog():\ncommon/fse.h:87:FSE_PUBLIC_API unsigned FSE_optimalTableLog(unsigned maxTableLog, size_t srcSize, unsigned maxSymbolValue);\ncommon/fse.h:89:/*! FSE_normalizeCount():\ncommon/fse.h:100:FSE_PUBLIC_API size_t FSE_normalizeCount(short* normalizedCounter, unsigned tableLog,\ncommon/fse.h:103:/*! FSE_NCountWriteBound():\ncommon/fse.h:106:FSE_PUBLIC_API size_t FSE_NCountWriteBound(unsigned maxSymbolValue, unsigned tableLog);\ncommon/fse.h:108:/*! FSE_writeNCount():\ncommon/fse.h:112:FSE_PUBLIC_API size_t FSE_writeNCount (void* buffer, size_t bufferSize,\ncommon/fse.h:125:/*! FSE_compress_usingCTable():\ncommon/fse.h:130:FSE_PUBLIC_API size_t FSE_compress_usingCTable (void* dst, size_t dstCapacity, const void* src, size_t srcSize, const FSE_CTable* ct);\ncommon/fse.h:144:FSE_normalizeCount() will ensure that sum of frequencies is == 2 ^'tableLog'.\ncommon/fse.h:147:If you are unsure of which tableLog value to use, you can ask FSE_optimalTableLog(),\ncommon/fse.h:150:The result of FSE_normalizeCount() will be saved into a table,\ncommon/fse.h:157:'normalizedCounter' can be saved in a compact manner to a memory area using FSE_writeNCount().\ncommon/fse.h:168:'CTable' can then be used to compress 'src', with FSE_compress_usingCTable().\ncommon/fse.h:204:This can be performed by FSE_readNCount() if it was saved using FSE_writeNCount().\ncommon/fse.h:252:unsigned FSE_optimalTableLog_internal(unsigned maxTableLog, size_t srcSize, unsigned maxSymbolValue, unsigned minus);\ncommon/fse.h:253:/**< same as FSE_optimalTableLog(), which used `minus==2` */\ncommon/fse.h:258:/* FSE_buildCTable_wksp() :\ncommon/fse.h:261: * See FSE_buildCTable_wksp() for breakdown of workspace usage.\ncommon/fse.h:265:size_t FSE_buildCTable_wksp(FSE_CTable* ct, const short* normalizedCounter, unsigned maxSymbolValue, unsigned tableLog, void* workSpace, size_t wkspSize);\ncommon/fse.h:305:These functions are inner components of FSE_compress_usingCTable().","is_error":false}]},"parent_tool_use_id":"toolu_bdrk_01EdjoTJD9HndCYCaGB7WVEa","session_id":"9325aeb1-fde7-405e-a2e0-217179ef0d1d","uuid":"2033f197-9063-4887-98ef-cc9f7e102af3","timestamp":"2026-08-31T08:09:47.971Z","subagent_type":"general-purpose","task_description":"Port huf_compress.c"}
